<!-- PAGE INTRO -->
<div class="ltcc-vc-intro">
<h1>Online Learning at LTCC</h1>
<p>Welcome to LTCC's virtual campus. Whether you're enrolled in a fully online course or a hybrid class, you'll find everything you need to get started and succeed &mdash; right here. LTCC delivers online courses through <a title="LTCC Canvas learning management system" href="https://laketahoecc.instructure.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canvas</a>, our learning management system.</p>
</div>
<!-- CTA BUTTONS -->
<table class="ou-cta-green"><caption>Call-To-Action Buttons</caption>
