<tr><!-- LEFT COLUMN: Tools + Resources -->
<td>
<h2>Tools You'll Use</h2>
<!-- Canvas -->
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool"><img class="ltcc-vc-tool-logo" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/canvas.png" alt="Canvas logo" width="56" height="56" />
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool-body">
<h3>Canvas</h3>
<p>Access your course materials, assignments, discussions, and grades through Canvas &mdash; LTCC's learning management system.</p>
<a title="Log in to Canvas to access your LTCC courses" href="https://laketahoecc.instructure.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go to Canvas &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<!-- Student Email -->
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool"><img class="ltcc-vc-tool-logo" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/icons/outlooklogo.jpg" alt="Microsoft Outlook logo" width="56" height="56" />
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool-body">
<h3>Student Email</h3>
<p>Your LTCC email is how instructors reach you. Check it regularly for announcements, grades, and updates.</p>
<a title="Access your LTCC student email through Passport" href="http://passport.ltcc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Access Student Email &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<!-- Zoom -->
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool"><img class="ltcc-vc-tool-logo" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/virtual_campus/zoomicon.jpg" alt="Zoom logo" width="56" height="56" />
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool-body">
<h3>Zoom</h3>
<p>Many LTCC classes and office hours use Zoom for live sessions. New employees can set up a free account through the CCC Chancellor's Office.</p>
<a title="Set up a free Zoom account through the CCC Chancellor's Office" href="https://www.conferzoom.org/ConferZoom/SignUp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get a Free Zoom Account &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<!-- Textbooks -->
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool">
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool-logo ltcc-vc-tool-logo-icon" aria-hidden="true">📚</div>
<div class="ltcc-vc-tool-body">
<h3>Textbooks</h3>
<p>Order your course materials through the LTCC online bookstore.</p>
<a title="Buy LTCC textbooks and course materials online" href="https://ltcc.ecampus.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop the Bookstore &rarr;</a></div>
</div>
<hr />
<h2>Additional Resources</h2>
<h3>Cranium Caf&eacute;</h3>
<p>Chat live with a counselor or student support staff member &mdash; no appointment needed.</p>
<p><a title="Chat live with an LTCC counselor on Cranium Caf&eacute;" href="http://ltcc.craniumcafe.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat with a counselor &rarr;</a></p>
<h3>Passport Student Portal</h3>
<p>Register for classes, view grades, download transcripts, apply for financial aid, and manage your account.</p>
<p><a title="Log in to the LTCC Passport student portal" href="http://passport.ltcc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Log in to Passport &rarr;</a></p>
<h3>Distance Education Policy</h3>
<p>Taking online courses from outside California? Review LTCC's state authorization policy.</p>
<p><a title="LTCC Distance Education Policy for students outside California &mdash; opens PDF" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/virtual_campus/distanceedpolicyoutsidecalifornia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> Read the Distance Education Policy (PDF) &rarr;</a></p>
</td>
